<title>GERMANY: Kaufhof Warenhaus 96 sales, profit rise.</title>
<headline>Kaufhof Warenhaus 96 sales, profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales					  9,549   vs 9,428</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retail group is Kaufhof Warenhaus AG, a unit of Metro AG. Company chief Lovro Mandac released the number on Tuesday evening. He also said 1996 profits had risen 30 percent but was not more specific. Mandac also said the unit planned similar earnings improvement in 1997 and said sales in the current year should reach just under 10 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
